#: ../../../source/user_guide/remote_execution.rst:170
msgid "Surviving Disconnects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/remote_execution.rst:172
msgid ""
"Holding an SSH channel open for the duration of a solve makes the job as "
"fragile as the connection. Instead the solver is launched **detached** "
"via ``Win32_Process.Create``, so the process is re-parented away from the"
" sshd session and survives the channel closing.  Progress is read from "
"files on the remote disk, which makes the poll loop stateless — it can "
"lose the connection, reconnect, and resume:"
msgstr ""

